  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "75:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '75'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19723:19738"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19738:19740"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你用螺丝刀对着录像机摆弄了一会，但是毫无进展。你拿不稳螺丝刀，不停地打滑。最后，你灰心丧气地把螺丝刀全力往卡住的按钮戳了下去。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19740:19805"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "录像机的塑料外壳裂开了。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19805:19819"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "螺丝刀穿透了磁带的廉价塑料外壳，一路穿过录像机的底面，刺进你手掌中间。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19819:19856"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你大叫着丢下录像机，抓着自己的手掌。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19856:19876"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "录像机毁掉了，录像带也烂了。你的手掌在不停流血。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19876:19902"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "记录你当前所在的条目，你可能需要回到当前条目。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19902:19927"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "受到 1 点伤害。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19927:19938"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "在记录表上勾选 双手染红。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19938:19953"
    },
    {
      "id": "75:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "回到 66。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19953:19961"
    }
  ]
}
